                        "entry_id": "5a011aef-3e4f-3a46-9352-56460a0e2312",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. по пути куда-либо, в том же направлении с кем-, чем-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fc3e7a0a-eeff-30b9-b6d9-8c551d462af1",
                        "entry_id": "5a011aef-3e4f-3a46-9352-56460a0e2312",
                        "glosses": [
                            "одновременно, наряду с чем-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "057847e0-40bd-4c7e-868a-145d05e787b0",
                                "sense_id": "fc3e7a0a-eeff-30b9-b6d9-8c551d462af1",
                                "text": "Что же касается уборки дома и прочих хозяйственных хлопот, так они всё равно будут нанимать домработницу, та попутно приберёт и вторую половину дома."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "004f4cdc-9023-4e71-a247-755aaff10f32",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a011aef-3e4f-3a46-9352-56460a0e2312",
                        "source_sense_description": "по пути",
                        "target_lang_word": "along the way",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "along the way",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca7b7a5a-17db-3f16-9812-def3f7a3510e",
                                        "entry_id": "e4e51f87-c364-3fce-a35d-40b555d165b6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "During the course of an ongoing process."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2075462-7037-4689-9c27-477e43b1002b",
                                                "sense_id": "ca7b7a5a-17db-3f16-9812-def3f7a3510e",
                                                "text": "Human,\n\"To hate blindly is as dangerous as to trust blindly.\" An old angaran proverb, one of many I have forgotten somewhere along the way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b6926635-fe7d-412b-a292-44cd99d31037",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a011aef-3e4f-3a46-9352-56460a0e2312",
                        "source_sense_description": "по пути",
                        "target_lang_word": "by the way",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "by the way",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cffdfdc4-0a90-3fc6-b3b0-5b6a0c36a0c1",
                                        "entry_id": "5a0237cf-352a-3c90-a1e0-cabe4f944ff2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incidentally; used in referencing a parenthetical statement not timely, central, or crucial to the topic at hand; foregone, passed by, something that has already happened."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive",
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "960ecbc3-56f7-4c24-a0ce-6006a5680d9e",
                                                "sense_id": "cffdfdc4-0a90-3fc6-b3b0-5b6a0c36a0c1",
                                                "text": "His mother will be coming for dinner tomorrow, and, by the way, she recently sold her collection of ceramic eggs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0b9a8e6-11ac-4afd-aa51-a9b9a3504884",
                                                "sense_id": "cffdfdc4-0a90-3fc6-b3b0-5b6a0c36a0c1",
                                                "text": "[…] I had counted on a life-lease of the profits, whereas I only received those of a few short years. But this is by the way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99bddfa7-1eaf-4659-8deb-12c6b75cdd10",
                                                "sense_id": "cffdfdc4-0a90-3fc6-b3b0-5b6a0c36a0c1",
                                                "text": "“A very welcome, kind, useful present, that means to the parish. By the way, Hopkins, let this go no further. We don't want the tale running round that a rich person has arrived. Churchill, my dear fellow, we have such greedy sharks, and wolves in lamb's clothing.[…]”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "by the way",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7c86ccf-5468-39af-b0e2-2d5cd5d76cc3",
                                        "entry_id": "e2f36a7d-732d-3fcc-a5ec-7cff983d603c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Irrelevantly, off-topic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "idiomatic",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "81628e5b-65b6-404e-b01d-a8addb407f07",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a011aef-3e4f-3a46-9352-56460a0e2312",
                        "source_sense_description": "по пути",
                        "target_lang_word": "on the way",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "on the way",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b907897b-354d-36ee-8082-28591255d2ce",
                                        "entry_id": "0b060b3e-b270-3ecd-b2c6-35833821bf4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Coming; approaching."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "914e6d3c-7513-4272-937b-3b7ccb9e58cd",
                                                "sense_id": "b907897b-354d-36ee-8082-28591255d2ce",
                                                "text": "Don't worry, Mr. President, help's on the way\nYour brothers are comin', there'll be hell to pay"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dd6d74c-4358-4bca-b783-cca66c86c8ac",
                                                "sense_id": "b907897b-354d-36ee-8082-28591255d2ce",
                                                "text": "Spring is on the way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3bd9ba5-9979-4899-a869-81f64196fb6f",
                                                "sense_id": "b907897b-354d-36ee-8082-28591255d2ce",
                                                "text": "Don't panic! Reinforcements are on the way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e48bb6ab-0786-3813-ac91-97afd486693e",
                                        "entry_id": "0b060b3e-b270-3ecd-b2c6-35833821bf4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Heading to a certain place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a03cfe0-ae22-48bf-8bd1-be6807ab5586",
                                                "sense_id": "e48bb6ab-0786-3813-ac91-97afd486693e",
                                                "text": "We are on our way to the train station."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e19d9a72-ba1d-3bcd-811d-6f6491fe33be",
                                        "entry_id": "0b060b3e-b270-3ecd-b2c6-35833821bf4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On the direct route that one intends to travel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddeca8e9-5a13-4c3f-9491-ec3ad0edb248",
                                                "sense_id": "e19d9a72-ba1d-3bcd-811d-6f6491fe33be",
                                                "text": "I can drop you at the station, as it is on my way home."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "592183b9-70b7-37af-b960-2bc01c88c53b",
                                        "entry_id": "0b060b3e-b270-3ecd-b2c6-35833821bf4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "On one's way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7848e31-3b87-3067-bf0e-28abb3af0f03",
                                        "entry_id": "0b060b3e-b270-3ecd-b2c6-35833821bf4b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "While travelling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e8e5d40-4f2f-471c-8b51-318a611ab452",
                                                "sense_id": "b7848e31-3b87-3067-bf0e-28abb3af0f03",
                                                "text": "We expressed our readiness, and in ten minutes were in the station wagon, rolling rapidly down the long drive, for it was then after nine. We passed on the way the van of the guests from Asquith."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa2b20f7-3739-4850-9704-0883ab8ee032",
                                                "sense_id": "b7848e31-3b87-3067-bf0e-28abb3af0f03",
                                                "text": "We gathered up what was left of the red deer after skinning and cleaning it, and set out upon our return journey toward the U-boat. On the way Olson, von Schoenvorts and I discussed the needs of our immediate future, and we were unanimous in placing foremost the necessity of a permanent camp on shore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ff59d247-e22c-4d0a-8f67-fab7af9e24e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a011aef-3e4f-3a46-9352-56460a0e2312",
                        "source_sense_description": "по пути",
                        "target_lang_word": "au passage",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "au passage",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d67a6f2-b577-3732-8524-e3424033d189",
                                        "entry_id": "37cf7c6c-a46e-38a8-a2d7-6d19228a4755",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dénote l’ajout d’un court argument."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4818a44b-c6fc-45c5-a7a9-66ae91c4fe08",
                                                "sense_id": "5d67a6f2-b577-3732-8524-e3424033d189",
                                                "text": "Elle a en effet mis les trois moyens d'information d’accord en commençant par occuper la radio, puis en mettant la main sur la télévision, tuant au passage une quatorzaine de Lituaniens indépendantistes et sans armes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58e80618-209a-4527-9f5d-2656aeb16e20",
                                                "sense_id": "5d67a6f2-b577-3732-8524-e3424033d189",
                                                "text": "La fanfare l’avait épargné, serpentante et alignée, et les couacs qu’il avait notés au passage ne lui étaient pas spécialement destinés."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ae33c4f-9208-43b4-bcc8-d69d44fb18a5",
                                                "sense_id": "5d67a6f2-b577-3732-8524-e3424033d189",
                                                "text": "Les trois larrons se ruèrent alors vers la sortie, bousculant au passage les videurs qui, comme à l’accoutumée, n’avaient rien vu rien entendu, et ils s’égayèrent dans les rues de la petite station balnéaire en ricanant comme des gosses espiègles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b939299-46d7-4469-b360-c33c4a359a7c",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a011aef-3e4f-3a46-9352-56460a0e2312",
                        "source_sense_description": "по пути",
                        "target_lang_word": "en route",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en route",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c53c1114-45ca-30d8-bdd6-2afbc14fdad6",
                                        "entry_id": "04590bf7-4455-31dc-9601-b986ab312532",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En cours de déplacement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5860010-0def-408e-8be5-1bee7aca0564",
                                                "sense_id": "c53c1114-45ca-30d8-bdd6-2afbc14fdad6",
                                                "text": "Il y a quinze jours qu’ils sont en route, qu’ils se sont mis en route."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e968a2d-cc5d-438c-ac81-c36f4712a62a",
                                                "sense_id": "c53c1114-45ca-30d8-bdd6-2afbc14fdad6",
                                                "text": "Il est resté en route."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ee159d5-fff9-423a-aca5-3ff791a9554c",
                                                "sense_id": "c53c1114-45ca-30d8-bdd6-2afbc14fdad6",
                                                "text": "Brissaud avait une intelligence merveilleuse, beaucoup de cœur, de l’ironie, et il dégageait une sympathie chaude. Cependant, il est demeuré en route, médicalement parlant, et il n’a pas joué le rôle prépondérant que tout semblait lui promettre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d01d0266-aac4-446d-99e7-6fa59332dccc",
                                                "sense_id": "c53c1114-45ca-30d8-bdd6-2afbc14fdad6",
                                                "text": "– Je reviendrai dans quelques instants.\n– Non, insista le valet. Monsieur m’a bien recommandé de vous dire de l’attendre ici. Il doit être d’ailleurs en route."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60f3e0a6-67f7-33ac-9660-06037eb1d3d3",
                                        "entry_id": "04590bf7-4455-31dc-9601-b986ab312532",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En cours d'exécution, en train de se réaliser."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6a47e29-24db-42f5-ac58-c3378f10e2c1",
                                                "sense_id": "60f3e0a6-67f7-33ac-9660-06037eb1d3d3",
                                                "text": "Maria resta là quelques instants, regardant le labeur des hommes et le résultat de ce labeur, plus frappant de jour en jour, puis elle reprit le chemin de la maison, balançant le seau vide, heureuse de se sentir vivante et forte sous le soleil éclatant, songeant confusément aux choses heureuses qui étaient en route et ne pouvaient manquer de venir bientôt, si elle priait avec assez de ferveur et de patience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8254a420-0b7d-405c-a54b-cab0e137b501",
                                                "sense_id": "60f3e0a6-67f7-33ac-9660-06037eb1d3d3",
                                                "text": "Puis il se tourna vers sa fille qui passait le café. Un second bébé était en route."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c514d601-d32b-3871-8edd-aacf2efc8873",
                                        "entry_id": "04590bf7-4455-31dc-9601-b986ab312532",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En marche, en parlant d'un appareil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39e71cc9-0e1e-4fbf-ba15-b0f75106d467",
                                                "sense_id": "c514d601-d32b-3871-8edd-aacf2efc8873",
                                                "text": "La machine est en route."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3e83000-eeea-38a9-b9ff-80340f7e1a36",
                                        "entry_id": "04590bf7-4455-31dc-9601-b986ab312532",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Au fil d'un cheminement personnel, d'une succession d'événements."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19705bfb-5c67-4838-8604-c9f7bae24734",
                                                "sense_id": "c3e83000-eeea-38a9-b9ff-80340f7e1a36",
                                                "text": "La Reine de la Nuit, au début était une mère qui cherchait partout sa fille persécutée par un méchant magicien, elle devient, en route, une incarnation des puissances occultes et malfaisantes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "en route",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "142bb363-a693-3728-9d72-854e0c5eaa1e",
                                        "entry_id": "2014a4d3-f308-3552-b3fe-d91fcf861e54",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dit pour signaler un départ, généralement pour un déplacement assez long."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bbf305d-afb1-449b-8f47-f52ed327bce4",
                                                "sense_id": "142bb363-a693-3728-9d72-854e0c5eaa1e",
                                                "text": "En route ! le ciel est bleu, le soleil brille, et nous nous sentons dans les pieds des envies de marcher sur l’herbe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9817cbe8-c461-4b1b-b067-351f30c08084",
                                                "sense_id": "142bb363-a693-3728-9d72-854e0c5eaa1e",
                                                "text": "Nous débarquons chez lui sur le coup de six heures ; nous y déposons nos valises et les colichemardes ; nous donnons un coup d'œil à la cuisine, et puis en route pour la pleine eau. C'est le vrai moment de se baigner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "af37c3f2-0f1d-42a9-a22d-1eb2a7d686b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a011aef-3e4f-3a46-9352-56460a0e2312",
                        "source_sense_description": "по пути",
                        "target_lang_word": "chemin faisant",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chemin faisant",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9fb77c8-4150-3814-bb3d-a1b95faadbc6",
                                        "entry_id": "acea6a56-fc90-36d3-8e00-0cd8f5da01de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En parcourant le chemin ; durant le trajet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "837e778e-1e67-462a-8b80-42a158e4e7a6",
                                                "sense_id": "e9fb77c8-4150-3814-bb3d-a1b95faadbc6",
                                                "text": "Chemin faisant , j’eus le plaisir de voir plusieurs Portugaises qui soulevaient leurs jalousies pour nous examiner. Il y en avait très peu de jolies ; mais une navigation de trois mois, et la difficulté de les voir , les rendaient charmantes à mes yeux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3985c93-61b0-4913-8944-43c58681e685",
                                                "sense_id": "e9fb77c8-4150-3814-bb3d-a1b95faadbc6",
                                                "text": "Chemin faisant l’émeute triomphait sans combattre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7f5870a-1869-4693-b309-2626750ffb9e",
                                                "sense_id": "e9fb77c8-4150-3814-bb3d-a1b95faadbc6",
                                                "text": "Et j’aperçois, chemin faisant, que je suis tout près aussi de ce bourg de Molières, où vécu le pharmacien Massabie, […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a90129a-f806-4751-a2bf-775e7c7228d1",
